
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Ibisohoka andika: laugh, umurongo-mushya.

>> locked := Ikinyoma.
>> security := Ukuri.
security ukuri: { locked := Ukuri. }.
Ibisohoka andika: locked, umurongo-mushya.

>> n := 7.
(Ukuri) ukuri: { n := 9. }.
Ibisohoka andika: n.
